---
/**
 * The address „Arhivă & Profil” used to answer at.
 *
 * The screen was split in three — the record of the year stayed, under
 * `/profesor/activitatea-mea`; the profile went to `/contul-meu`; the seats
 * request went to the dashboard, at `#locuri`. This file cannot be deleted
 * afterwards: the address is written in emails already delivered (the seats
 * decision carried it as its call to action) and in whatever bookmarks people
 * made of it.
 *
 * `search` travels along, so a link to a chosen year lands on that year.
 * A fragment never reaches the server — the browser re-attaches it to the
 * target of the redirect, and `/profesor/activitatea-mea` forwards `#locuri`
 * onward from there.
 */
return Astro.redirect(`/profesor/activitatea-mea${Astro.url.search}`, 301)
